# ===================================================
# Birthday Magic - Cloudflare Workers Configuration
# ===================================================
#
# Bindings are configured in wrangler.jsonc:
# - D1 Database: DB (birthday-wish-db)
# - R2 Bucket: MEDIA (birthday-wish-media)
# - Assets: ASSETS (./dist)
#
# Create D1 database: npx wrangler d1 create birthday-wish-db
# Create R2 bucket:   npx wrangler r2 bucket create birthday-wish-media
#
# Optional custom API base (defaults to same-origin /api):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
